Coulomb truncation method
  LTRUNCATE          =      F  Coulomb kernel truncation to be used


 Exchange correlation treatment:
   GGA     = PS    functional components
   XC_C    = 1    coefficients multiplying the functional components
   LIBXC   =     F    Libxc                    
